OL,3,GNEWSATown centre car parks partly close
OL,4,Afor two months
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo town centre car parks will be
OL,7,Fpartly closed for two months while
OL,8,Farchaeological investigations take
OL,9,Fplace.
OL,11,FThe "essential works" at Upper Mounts
OL,12,Fand Newlands Car Parks in Northampton
OL,13,Fare being carried out in preparation
OL,14,Ffor the Greyfriars regeneration scheme.
OL,16,FWest Northamptonshire Council and
OL,17,FEnglish Cities Fund (ECF) hope to
OL,18,Fsubmit a planning application for a
OL,19,Fmajor redevelopment around the former
OL,20,Fbus station site.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,368,360,200,160,0,100
