OL,3,GNEWSATown centre car parks partly close
OL,4,Afor two months
OL,5,
OL,6,FKamala Guliyeva, cabinet member for
OL,7,FLocal Economy, Culture and Leisure,
OL,8,Fsaid: "The short-term inconvenience
OL,9,Fwill help unlock substantial long-term
OL,10,Fbenefits for Northampton and support a
OL,11,Fstronger, more vibrant town centre."
